{"id":"80b21a90a0262f70","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md","title":"说谎者在所有一致强Kleene固定点中是gap","display":"thm-liar-sentence-properties — 说谎者在所有一致强Kleene固定点中是gap","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-liar-sentence-properties","aliases":["91-thm-liar-sentence-properties","91-thm-liar-properties","91-thm-liar-characterization"],"display":"thm-liar-sentence-properties — 说谎者在所有一致强Kleene固定点中是gap","depends_on":["[[91-df-liar-sentence]]","[[91-df-truth-value-gap]]","[[91-df-strong-kleene]]","[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","[[91-df-jump-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-liar-sentence-properties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-liar-sentence-properties</span><span>91-thm-liar-properties</span><span>91-thm-liar-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-liar-sentence-properties — 说谎者在所有一致强Kleene固定点中是gap"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cac035693aea2791\" href=\"?note=cac035693aea2791\" title=\"91-df-liar-sentence\">91-df-liar-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8747011468390705\" href=\"?note=8747011468390705\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-gap\">91-df-truth-value-gap</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fcfe6f023ac58abf\" href=\"?note=fcfe6f023ac58abf\" title=\"91-df-strong-kleene\">91-df-strong-kleene</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2bc1263010e83604\" href=\"?note=2bc1263010e83604\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-function\">91-df-truth-value-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-liar-sentence-properties-—-说谎者在所有一致强-Kleene-固定点中是-gap\">thm-liar-sentence-properties — 说谎者在所有一致强 Kleene 固定点中是 gap</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> (满足\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span> 的说谎者)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_{\\mathrm{SK}}\">\\(J_{\\mathrm{SK}}\\)</span> (强 Kleene 真理跳跃)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\\)</span> (一致固定点类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span> (固定点评价)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}liar\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\\,\nv_\\Gamma(\\lambda)=\\mathbf u.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}liar\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\\,\nv_\\Gamma(\\lambda)=\\mathbf u.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若一致固定点把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 判真，对角式要求\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span> 为假；固定点透明性又要求它为真。判假时\n同理产生冲突。因此两种确定值都被一致性排除，只剩 gap。</p>\n<p>结论只量化一致固定点。裸 KF 还可有允许 glut 的模型；在经典外层结构\n中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span> 只表示编码未落入真理外延，\n不能与三值内部否定或“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\lambda\">\\(\\neg\\lambda\\)</span> 落入固定点”混为一谈。FS 的\ncapture/release 规则行为也不是 Kripke 固定点的同一个语义命题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-liar-sentence-properties-—-说谎者在所有一致强-Kleene-固定点中是-gap","text":"thm-liar-sentence-properties — 说谎者在所有一致强 Kleene 固定点中是 gap","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-liar-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"cac035693aea2791","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-liar-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-value-gap","status":"resolved","id":"8747011468390705","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-gap]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-strong-kleene","status":"resolved","id":"fcfe6f023ac58abf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-strong-kleene]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-value-function","status":"resolved","id":"2bc1263010e83604","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"J_{\\mathrm{SK}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})","display":false},{"tex":"v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{S